          "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
          "maps_to": null,
          "text": "To ensure the safety of all passengers, please hold the handrail."
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 550.1,
          "end_sec": 554.8,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
          "maps_to": null,
          "text": "下一站，中心庄，换乘地铁八号线的乘客，请准备下车。The next station, Zhongxinzhuang, change here for line 8."
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 650.5,
          "end_sec": 653.5,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
          "maps_to": null,
          "text": "列车即将到达，生命科学园站。We are now arriving at Life Science Park."
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 750.1,
          "end_sec": 752.5,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
          "maps_to": null,
          "text": "列车即将到达中心庄站。We are now arriving at Zhongxinzhuang."
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 800.5,
          "end_sec": 803.5,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
          "maps_to": null,
          "text": "请您站稳扶好，不要倚靠车门。Please stand firm and hold the handrail."
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 831.5,
          "end_sec": 833.2,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "终于又在地铁里面自己做饭的麻烦。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 833.5,
          "end_sec": 834.0,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "我中午。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 834.3,
          "end_sec": 837.5,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "哎，我搞了一个，我搞了一个小灶，然后可以在里面烧的。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 838.1,
          "end_sec": 839.0,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "今天中午吃火锅吗？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 839.3,
          "end_sec": 841.0,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "不是，烧火的，不是烧电的。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 841.5,
          "end_sec": 841.8,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "这样的？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 842.4,
          "end_sec": 842.6,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 842.7,
          "end_sec": 843.0,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "这么牛吗？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 843.8,
          "end_sec": 844.8,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "这还会报警吗？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 845.0,
          "end_sec": 846.8,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "不会啊。没有，没有烟，烟是直的。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 847.8,
          "end_sec": 848.5,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "这有水蒸气吧？"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 851.8,
          "end_sec": 852.2,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "还可以。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 853.0,
          "end_sec": 854.5,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "煮煮火锅啊，什么的，是可以。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 855.2,
          "end_sec": 856.8,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "这是我的户外装备。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1114.5,
          "end_sec": 1116.0,
          "speaker": "SPEAKER_02",
          "maps_to": "p2",
          "text": "哦，这个不是开黑的，是开灰机的。"
        },
        {
          "start_sec": 1116.2,
          "end_sec": 1116.8,
          "speaker": "myself",
          "maps_to": "p1",
          "text": "这个皮的是开飞机的。"
